LibRedirect Mobile builds on the following third-party software and data.
This file is updated as dependencies are added; it reflects what is
currently declared in android/app/build.gradle.kts and tools/package.json.

## Routing data source

- LibRedirect (https://github.com/libredirect) — GNU General Public
  License v3.0. The routing manifest generated by tools/ is derived from
  LibRedirect's browser extension configuration and instance list.

